# card42 eMRTD personalization script - demo set (ICAO Doc 9303-11 sample).
#
# One section per instance (EmrtdPersoExporter).  The demo data is
# comprehensive (DG1..DG16 except the reserved DG6) and every algorithm
# that can be present at once is: PACE and Chip Authentication advertise
# 3DES + AES-128; Terminal Authentication carries an ECDSA and an RSA-PSS
# CVCA trust point.  Only AA is mutually exclusive and chosen by suffix
# (@aa-alg), e.g. sample-sha256.perso.
#
#   @instance <AID-hex>          start a section
#   @doc/@dob/@doe               MRZ fields (LDS1: BAC + PACE f(MRZ))
#   @can <6 digits>              Card Access Number for PACE (ref 0x02)
#   @dg <n> <hex>                EF.DG<n> content
#   @sod <hex>                   EF.SOD content
#   @aa <hex>                    RSA AA private key (modLen||mod||expLen||exp)
#   @aa-ec <hex>                 ECDSA AA private scalar (P-256)
#   @aa-alg sha1|sha256|ecdsa    AA signature algorithm
#   @ca <hex>                    CA static P-256 private scalar (DGI FF03)
#   @cardsecurity <hex>          master-file EF.CardSecurity (DGI FF05)
#   @ta-date <YYMMDD>            ICC current date (DGI FF08)
#   @cvca <W> <CAR> <date> <auth> [secondary]        EC CVCA trust point
#   @cvca-rsa <n> <e> <CAR> <date> <auth> [secondary] RSA CVCA trust point
#   @lds2 <role> / @record <fid> <hex> / @transparent <fid> <hex>
#
# PACE credentials are card-wide: DGI FF04/FF06 personalized by the
# LDS1 section are inherited by every LDS2 application, so the LDS2
# sections below carry neither @doc nor @can.  An LDS2 section may
# still write them to override the value for the whole card.
#
# The EF.SOD is signed by the DSC fixture (perso/emrtd/dsc.crt + dsc.key);
# the AA/CA keys are throwaway demo keys.  NEVER use them on a real card.
# Regenerate with `EmrtdPersoExporter -emit [-aa=<sha1|sha256|ecdsa>]`.
@instance A0000002471001
@doc L898902C<
@dob 690806
@doe 940623
@can 123456
@dg 1 615B5F1F58503C55544F4552494B53534F4E3C3C414E4E413C4D415249413C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C4C383938393032433C3355544F3639303830363146393430363233365A45313834323236423C3C3C3C3C3134
